  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Originally a patient, she was accepted by Rhodes Island because she was found to be incredibly observant in examinations. Assigned to Reserve Op Team A6.",
        "zh": "作为患者被罗德岛接收，因能力出众，在征求本人意见后，接受并通过测试，成为罗德岛的一员，被分配到预备行动组A6。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 2%\nCrystallization is visible on body surface, with many symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.30u/L\nMid-stage infection but in stable condition. Regular observation and treatment required.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】2%\n包括体表的源石结晶在内，干员空爆拥有明显的感染者症状。\n\n【血液内源石密度】0.30u/L. \n感染步入中期，患者目前病程控制稳定。需要保持定期观察与控制。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "She is a soldier in Reserve Op Team A6.\nThe problem child of A6, she loves to stick her nose where it doesn't belong and stir the pot. \nCatapult is a repeat offender who always gets into trouble and irritates Orchid in particular..",
        "zh": "预备行动组A6的一员，士兵出身。\nA6的问题儿童，平日吊儿郎当，看到热闹就会凑上去煽风点火，甚至自己也插一脚进去。\n因为相比其他队友，属于明知故犯的类型，所以每次出事总是被梓兰批评得最狠的那一个。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "She didn't make a big mess in the last city she served. \nThe mayor didn't step down, no one suspended the construction of the dam, and the vaults she blew up only accounted for a fraction of the city's revenue. \nJust a matter of time before the consequences finally kick in.",
        "zh": "空爆过去服役的那座城市并没有因为她的行为产生巨大的改变。\n城主并没有因此下台，也没有停止横征暴敛，甚至空爆炸掉的金库也只是城主众多财富中的九牛一毛。\n不过，她的行为也并不是完全没有带来影响。只是，这份影响距离开花结果，尚有一段时日。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Catapult actually enjoys hearing Orchid's critiques, and even deliberately makes her angry sometimes. \nBecause she knows Orchid means well, she makes trouble for her.",
        "zh": "空爆事实上相当享受梓兰的批评，有时候甚至是故意去惹她生气的。\n因为她知道，愿意这么对待她的，才是真心对她好的。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Catapult often avoids responsibility and work. It is hard to say if this is because she is simply rebellious, or something left over from her time in the military, or both.\nBut she is a good girl, otherwise she wouldn't have blown up the vaults. Although she wasn't happy with it, she did the best she could. In addition, since her time at Rhodes Island, she has never neglected her duty. \nIf one day Rhodes Island disappoints her, she just might blow something up and leave. Hopefully, that day never comes.",
        "zh": "空爆喜欢推卸责任，逃避工作，很难说，这是她性格中叛逆的成分作祟，还是她过去服役军队的风气使然，或许兼而有之。\n但她的本性还是善良的，否则，也不会做下炸金库这样的事。虽然结果并不如人意，但那已经是她所能做到的极限。而且，来到罗德岛后，她虽然吊儿郎当，却也从没有玩忽职守。\n若是有一天罗德岛令她失望，说不定她也会炸点什么然后一走了之吧，但愿，那一天永远不会到来。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
